# Zerodha Auto-Trading App: Project Folder Structure

```text
autotrade-zerodha/
├── app/
│   ├── config/
│   │   ├── settings.py                # App settings loader (env + defaults)
│   │   └── logging.yaml               # Central logging configuration
│   ├── data/
│   │   ├── market_stream.py           # Live ticks/candles from Kite WebSocket/API
│   │   ├── historical_loader.py       # Historical OHLC fetch for backtests
│   │   └── instruments_cache.py       # Instrument master caching
│   ├── strategy/
│   │   ├── base.py                    # Strategy interface
│   │   ├── momentum_breakout.py       # Example strategy implementation
│   │   └── mean_reversion.py          # Optional alternate strategy
│   ├── risk/
│   │   ├── position_sizing.py         # Qty calculation by risk per trade
│   │   ├── guards.py                  # Daily max loss, max trades, kill switch
│   │   └── sl_tp.py                   # Stop-loss / target logic
│   ├── execution/
│   │   ├── broker_kite.py             # Zerodha API wrapper
│   │   ├── order_manager.py           # Place/modify/cancel orders + retries
│   │   └── paper_broker.py            # Paper trading adapter
│   ├── portfolio/
│   │   ├── positions.py               # Open/closed positions tracking
│   │   └── pnl.py                     # Realized/unrealized P&L computation
│   ├── monitoring/
│   │   ├── alerts.py                  # Telegram/email alerts
│   │   └── healthcheck.py             # Liveness checks + API connectivity
│   ├── storage/
│   │   ├── db.py                      # DB connection/session
│   │   ├── models.py                  # Trade/order/candle schemas
│   │   └── repositories.py            # Data access layer
│   ├── api/
│   │   ├── server.py                  # Optional FastAPI status dashboard backend
│   │   └── routes.py                  # Endpoints for status/reports/control
│   └── main.py                        # Runtime entrypoint (live/paper mode)
├── backtests/
│   ├── engine.py                      # Backtest runner
│   ├── metrics.py                     # CAGR, Sharpe, max drawdown, expectancy
│   └── scenarios/                     # Scenario configs (symbol, timeframe, dates)
├── scripts/
│   ├── run_live.sh                    # Start live trading
│   ├── run_paper.sh                   # Start paper trading
│   ├── run_backtest.sh                # Launch a backtest job
│   └── bootstrap.sh                   # Setup env, folders, migrations
├── tests/
│   ├── unit/
│   │   ├── test_strategy.py
│   │   ├── test_risk_guards.py
│   │   └── test_position_sizing.py
│   └── integration/
│       ├── test_order_flow.py
│       └── test_paper_session.py
├── configs/
│   ├── app.dev.yaml                   # Development config
│   ├── app.prod.yaml                  # Production config
│   └── strategy.momentum.yaml         # Strategy parameters
├── infra/
│   ├── Dockerfile
│   ├── docker-compose.yml
│   └── systemd/autotrade.service      # VPS service definition
├── .env.example                        # API keys + environment variable template
├── requirements.txt
├── pyproject.toml
└── README.md
```

## Recommended Build Order
1. `execution/broker_kite.py` + `execution/paper_broker.py`
2. `strategy/base.py` + one simple strategy
3. `risk/guards.py` + `risk/position_sizing.py`
4. `portfolio/` and `storage/` tracking
5. `backtests/engine.py` and metrics
6. Monitoring + alerts + dashboard API

## Minimum Safety Controls Before Going Live
- Risk per trade capped (for example: 0.5% to 1% of capital)
- Daily max loss guard and automatic shutdown
- Max open positions and max trades/day
- Mandatory stop-loss placement for every order
- Kill switch from config or API endpoint

## Suggested Modes
- **Paper mode**: full data + simulated orders
- **Shadow mode**: live signals logged, no orders
- **Live mode**: real orders with strict risk guards
